   "etapa": "explicar",
   "piezas": [
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "Future of być",
     "texto": [
      "To say «I will be», use **będę, będziesz, będzie, będziemy, będziecie, będą**.",
      "English has one verb, «be», for both ideas, and Polish also uses **być** for both."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    },
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "Future of other verbs",
     "texto": [
      "For a future plan or activity, use a form of **będę** + infinitive: **będę czytać** («I will read»), **będziesz pracować** («you will work»).",
      "Unlike Spanish, but like English «I will read», the main verb does not change; only **będę** changes."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    },
